==================================================
TEST PASS RATE
==================================================

Calculate:

Executed Tests =
PASSED + FAILED + BLOCKED + SKIPPED

Pass Rate =
PASSED / Executed Tests × 100

Failure Rate =
FAILED / Executed Tests × 100

Blocked Rate =
BLOCKED / Executed Tests × 100

Do not count NOT TESTED as executed.

